        "created_at": "2012-09-25T00:32:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey guys. My boardgaming group and I are participating in the Extra Life charity marathon on 10/20. We're planning on playing board games for 24 hours straight to raise money for Children's Miracle Network hospitals, in our case Duke Children's Hospital.</p>\n<p>We don't have any games finalized, but I would really love to see if we can work in a game against every SotM villain (individually!). That couldn't possibly take much longer than… 10 hours of our time, right? Not sure if the rest of the guys would be up for it, but if I can get some donations in support of that plan that can only help.<br><br>If you're interested in donating, you can do so <a href=\"http://www.extra-life.org/index.cfm?fuseaction=donorDrive.participant&amp;amp;eventID=508&amp;amp;participantID=30818\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">here</a>. Thanks!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:36:14.816Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
